<%# Turbo-frame response for the sidebar documentation search (mirrors /hilfe).
    The list body lives in _results (shared with the initial render in _search_box).
    Result links target _top — they navigate the whole page and carry q= so the
    opened page pre-fills the field and the client highlights the hit live. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag 'documentation-search-results' do %>
  <%= render 'results' %>
<% end %>
